{"4396440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Stop - No Vacancy", "steam_appid": 4396440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Stop is an anthology of short horror games - an episodic experience inspired by classic horror stories. </strong><br><strong>No Vacancy is the first episode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nancy, a hard-edged investigative reporter with nicotine stains on her fingers and a nose for lies, was burning rubber toward the nowhere town of Crestfall to dig into an arson that smelled like insurance money and revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But she took a wrong turn and ended up on a long road with no road signs and no GPS signal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's how she rolled up on the Paradise Motel just as the last smear of daylight bled out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nancy’s big break might be waiting behind one of those doors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe it's something more insidious...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396440/extras/66f0bac5804920642cc711da37b07a1b.poster.avif?t=1787002901\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396440/extras/66f0bac5804920642cc711da37b07a1b.webm?t=1787002901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396440/extras/66f0bac5804920642cc711da37b07a1b.mp4?t=1787002901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One night. One motel. No escape.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles built around the motel's dark history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story told through objects, not cutscenes</p